{"updated":"2026-10-20T14:02:15.293Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"Det7CS2EwqO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Det7CS2EwqO","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"@leo.malilion 我的AI助手👋 threads.com/@leo…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T13:18:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DerajejE32g","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DerajejE32g","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"做了一個帝王模擬器遊戲 會有人想玩嗎？？","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:55:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T17:14:28+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeqmqapADtG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeqmqapADtG","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"我把沙子、岩漿、液態氮，甚至黑洞，全部塞進一個 HTML 檔案裡了！🧪\n\n最近做了一個叫 PixelChem的像素物理化學沙盒遊戲\n\n它不是單純播放動畫，而是讓每個像素都有自己的物理與化學反應\n\n🌋 岩漿碰到水會生成黑曜石，蒸氣還能凝結成雨\n\n⚡ 閃電可以沿著水和金屬傳導，引爆整排火藥\n\n🧊 液態氮能讓水結冰，鋁熱劑則能熔穿金屬\n\n🌀 黑洞會吸走周圍像素，甚至能把重力反轉！\n\n還內建 4 種實驗場景：火山生態、酸液迷宮、連環爆破塔、水力閃電迴路。\n\n最有趣的是，整個遊戲只用一個 `index.html`，靠原生 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 與元胞自動機實現，不需要框架或建置工具。\n\n還支援熱像儀、氣流視覺化、截圖與錄影。\n\n你會先研究物理反應，還是直接把整張地圖炸掉？","timestamp":"2026-10-19T06:24:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T17:14:28+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deqm4rNkypq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Deqm4rNkypq","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🎮 線上體驗：\nmalilion.github.io/Pixel…","timestamp":"2026-10-19T06:24:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T17:14:28+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeqgXimEyAe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeqgXimEyAe","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Claude Code 開放 mods 兩週多了，\n很多人第一次看到它，是有人在 Claude Code 裡做出俄羅斯方塊。\n\n但重點不是 Tetris，\n是你現在可以改 Claude Code 自己的 harness。\n\nmod 是一段 JS／TS，直接跑在 Claude Code 裡面：\n1️⃣ 改寫 prompt、攔下或改寫 tool call\n2️⃣ 在介面加 pane、按鈕、自己的 /command\n3️⃣ 幫 subagent 換模型，或把某個請求丟給別的模型\n\n官方自己的 /diff、AGENTS.md 支援，也是用 mod 寫的。\n\n但先知道一件事：\nmod 沒有 sandbox，跑起來就是你的權限。\n讀得到你的檔案、環境變數裡的 API key，也看得到每個 prompt。\n\n所以裝之前我會先做兩件事：\n✅ 用 claude plugin validate 看它掛了哪些事件、要做什麼\n✅ 只從信得過的作者和 marketplace 裝\n\n你會先改 UI，還是先改 execution loop？\n連結放留言 👇","timestamp":"2026-10-19T05:27:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T17:14:28+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeqgXhTk_Wp","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeqgXhTk_Wp","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"官方文件：code.claude.com/docs…\n官方範例 mods（token-weather、blast-radius、replay-theater）：github.com/anthr…\n\n終端機要 Claude Code v2.1.287 以上，預設就開著。\n想全部關掉：在 ~/.claude/settings.json 設 \"disableAllHooks\": true，或單次用 --safe-mode 啟動。","timestamp":"2026-10-19T05:27:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T17:14:28+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deos54_E84f","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Deos54_E84f","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"開源遊戲不是只有 Doom 和貪食蛇。\n\n我找到一份把開源遊戲整理成「逛街地圖」的 GitHub 清單：從動作、解謎、賽車、Roguelike，到城市建造、RPG、即時戰略，README 目前列出 18 個遊戲分類。想找週末能玩的作品，或想研究別人怎麼做遊戲，都可以從類型開始挖。\n\n幾個例子很有意思：OpenRCT2 重做《過山車大亨 2》；Endless Sky 把太空探索、交易和戰鬥放在一起；Mindustry 則把沙盒與塔防揉成一款遊戲。清單也收錄 Godot、Bevy 等引擎作品，還有許多經典遊戲的重製與引擎重寫。\n\n它的價值不只是「免費遊戲列表」，而是把散落各處的開源遊戲入口放在同一張索引裡。挑一個熟悉的類型，再沿著 source 連結看原始專案，玩家和開發者都能找到下一站。\n\n收藏這份清單，下次想玩或想拆解遊戲時就不用從零搜尋。","timestamp":"2026-10-18T12:38:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T17:14:28+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Deos52SE8Gs","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Deos52SE8Gs","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GitHub：bobeff/open-source-games\ngithub.com/bobef…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」！\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-10-18T12:38:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T17:14:28+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DetyHkhgbCp","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DetyHkhgbCp","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"小編剛看到卡友在討論公廁設計👀\n\n原 PO 覺得在外用「坐式馬桶」\n還要擦酒精、墊衛生紙超麻煩\n猜想多數人應該更愛乾淨俐落的「蹲式馬桶」\n但為何現在百貨公司或公共場所\n卻幾乎都以坐式居多呢？\n\n想問問大家出門在外\n是「蹲式派」還是「坐式派」呀？🚻","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:00:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":13,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DetyI1pgevC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DetyI1pgevC","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨ 為何很多地方的廁所都是坐式馬桶\n✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:00:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DetrNyeEVMO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DetrNyeEVMO","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"小編看到有卡友驚呼 長大後才發現\n每個人的「衛生習慣」差很大👀\n\n原 PO 說從小覺得天天刷牙洗澡是基本常識\n長大才發現身邊居然不少人不愛刷牙\n甚至還有同事是「兩天才洗一次澡」\n讓他大開眼界\n\n大家出社會後\n有遇過什麼讓人震驚的「獨特衛生習慣」嗎？","timestamp":"2026-10-20T10:59:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DetrO8hkfRg","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DetrO8hkfRg","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨長大後才發現每個人衛生習慣不同\n✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:00:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Detkb0lgckm","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Detkb0lgckm","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"小編看到有女孩因為曖昧對象的「名字」\n而猶豫要不要交往👀\n\n朋友介紹認識了一個男生給她\n曖昧了一個月 也確定了心意 \n男生性格還不錯 也常常說要見爸媽 \n然後知道男生名字叫 x傳宗 之後 \n突然覺得壓力有點大 \n才剛畢業 生育的事還很遠 \n因此原PO萌生了想分手的念頭\n\n想問問大家會怎麼建議原 PO 呢？😳","timestamp":"2026-10-20T10:00:43.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DetkczgAQQU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DetkczgAQQU","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨男生名字⋯讓我不想談下去✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多感情的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-20T10:00:51.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DerbBqQD2xx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DerbBqQD2xx","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"水瓶男請舉手！！\n這裡有人需要你們解答🥶\n\n有人發文說和水瓶男曖昧幾個月 進展緩慢\n對方從秒回訊息 分享慾高\n到最近半天回一次 都是順著話題回而已\n最近一次回話還有點酸 雖然後來又正常了\n這就是大家口中的忽冷忽熱嗎🥲\n還是差不多👋了","timestamp":"2026-10-19T14:00:01.000Z","stats":{"likes":185,"replies":43,"reposts":0,"shares":26},"score":271,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DerURsOAeSS","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DerURsOAeSS","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"朋友超小氣🤯出國一趟毀三觀！\n原文來自➡️ 韓國行也算是看清一個人… ⬅️\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊主題的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:01:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":22,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":5},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DerUQVmgdUe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DerUQVmgdUe","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"韓國行也算是看清一個人….....","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:00:51.000Z","stats":{"likes":954,"replies":164,"reposts":0,"shares":1500},"score":1282,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DerNW86ALnT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DerNW86ALnT","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自➡️ 韓團的隊長都在做什麼 ⬅️\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多追星主題的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-19T12:00:35.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DerNWEzgObI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DerNWEzgObI","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"不懂就問\n韓團的隊長都在做什麼呀～？\n\n小編看到有人提出這個疑問\n韓團的各個角色大概都能理解\n唯獨隊長不知道大概會做什麼\n是不是只有得獎時代表發言而已呢\n有韓團知識家能解惑嗎？？","timestamp":"2026-10-19T12:00:28.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"Det2IUelDaW","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Det2IUelDaW","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"掃描 PDF 想改字，先看 OCR 能力。PDNob 這篇實測涵蓋多語言、傾斜文件與表格，也能整理 PDF 重點。編輯器可買斷，但 AI 助理要另訂閱，7 天試用後會自動續訂；免費版又有哪些限制？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:35:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Det2I8zFE6J","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Det2I8zFE6J","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:35:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DethJTLlNpY","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DethJTLlNpY","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"葉師傅這次不只要打十個，還會遇上薩諾斯？創作者「魚羊做遊戲」把電影梗做成 Roguelike，同人遊戲得顧體力、閃避與防禦，賺金幣再升級。作者實玩後，哪些地方最容易翻車？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-20T09:31:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DethJv9FItw","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DethJv9FItw","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T09:32:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Detg1ABgXaI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Detg1ABgXaI","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"希臘真是貓狗友善國家，我覺得甚至超越土耳其","timestamp":"2026-10-20T09:29:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T22:03:52+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DetMz83lD9b","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DetMz83lD9b","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"手把變小，按鍵不用跟著省？Xbox Nano 保留 18 個標準遊戲輸入，內建充電電池，也支援無線與藍牙。美國預購價 49.99 美元，11 月起陸續上市；各地售價、供應時間仍依當地公告。適合哪些玩家、還有哪些功能？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-20T06:34:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DetM0lZlLw9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DetM0lZlLw9","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T06:34:23.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Des35BFFHRz","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Des35BFFHRz","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T03:31:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Des34eyFKzm","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Des34eyFKzm","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Windows 紀念桌布，竟留著 Mac 的線索？微軟慶祝 Insider 12 週年推出 10 張桌布，工程師卻發現檔案中繼資料指向 Mac 版 Photoshop。這段小插曲怎麼曝光的？4000×4000 桌布也能直接下載。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-20T03:31:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DesjV1Zk8lt","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DesjV1Zk8lt","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:31:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DesjOUWE22n","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DesjOUWE22n","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"辛苦解完 100% 成就，DLC 一更新又得重刷？Steam 正在 Beta 測試「成就集」，讓本體與追加內容分組計算，既有完成紀錄也能保留。不過還需要開發者設定，並非所有遊戲都已支援；新版頁面有哪些改變？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:30:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DerRREilJLf","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DerRREilJLf","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-19T12:34:44.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DerRQhAlA5H","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DerRQhAlA5H","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"從 iPhone 16 Pro 換到 iPhone 18 Pro Max，一個多月後最有感的只有相機嗎？這篇作者心得整理日常操作、人像、夜景與續航，也談到長焦低光和自動亮度的不足。實拍與使用情境一起看，個人體驗不等於每個人的結果。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-19T12:34:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"DeornCBjXc5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DeornCBjXc5","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"一直以來覺得自己是個幸運的人，我沒有什麼特別的地方，但就是執行力很強，想到什麼做什麼，而且有很多天馬行空的想法。\n\n從去年五月，發現 AI語音模型差不多已經可以開始有點實用性了，就開始做 AI懶人報的 Podcast，解決自己的 AI FOMO 也幫助到很多人，但聽起來還是有非常多不自然的地方，最近也換了更自然的模型！\n\n幾週前，Opus 5.5 釋出已經到了做影片強到誇張的地步，並且幾乎可以 one shot 就可以 release 的階段。我立馬把流程大改，覺得好像可以應用在 YouTube 跟其他平台的經營了，同步也把影片丟到 Facebook，成效超乎異常的好。\n\n剛好入手了一台 Mac Mini，沒事就是不斷幫我做影片🚀\n\n這兩週社群流程到了一個不同的境界，最大的瓶頸就是等我review..\n\n兩週內追蹤數：\nYoutube: 3000 -> 破萬\nFB: 3000 -> 1.1 萬\nIG: 900 -> 2700\n\n在這個 AI Slop 泛濫的年代，我覺得做出來的東西有人看，真的是一件非常幸福且幸運的事！\n\n每都想到我的內容幫助到很多人，就更有動力繼續做下去了～！！","timestamp":"2026-10-18T12:27:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":380,"replies":31,"reposts":18,"shares":146},"score":496,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeornpLDQII","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DeornpLDQII","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"歡迎追蹤Youtube：\nyoutube.com/@ai.l…","timestamp":"2026-10-18T12:27:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"Des7xeKkdSQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Des7xeKkdSQ","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"請大家告訴大家\n如果你的 Claude 還有重置券\n即將於 10/23 後到期\n\n一定要使用！\nClaude 的重置券非常珍貴\n\n另外提醒 Claude 的重置是不會重設時間的\n\n例如我週日本來就是 weekly limit reset\n假設我在明天使用重置卷\n就必須要在三天左右的時間燒完 weekly limit \n不然禮拜天就又 reset 了","timestamp":"2026-10-20T04:05:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":69,"replies":16,"reposts":2,"shares":60},"score":107,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deq6FsPj-JH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Deq6FsPj-JH","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Iterm2 改版，現在原生支援 Claude Code 執行狀態\n\n以前也不是不行，只是要自己寫 hook 魔改...\n現在原生支援就是挺不錯\n\n實測用其他的 Codex CLI, agy, grok build, 都沒有支援 icon","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:13:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":14,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deotunvj6Nu","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Deotunvj6Nu","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"這次出國旅遊兩個多禮拜\n帶回接近 1tb 和 1500 分鐘的影片素材...\n一想到要整理跟剪接就完全沒動力\n\n想說如果 AI 和 Claude Opus 真的那麼強\n那就全部都丟給它處理吧\n整理素材 → 剪重點 → 加上資訊動畫\n\n整體心得：節奏還算及格，而且有亮點\n\n蠻會抓重點的，幾乎能辨識到畫面中重要的景點\n最喜歡的部分是資訊圖卡標出時間、現在在哪\n搭交通工具時會給路線小地圖\n健行時也會把路線跟高度都顯示在畫面上\n但 AI 對於解釋畫面的字幕還是會有點尬\n\n下方影片的畫面全都是靠 @insta360 的 GO Ultra\n蠻推薦出國旅遊時帶這種簡易小巧的廣角相機\n完全解放雙手！偶爾重要的景點還是會拿 iPhone 出來拍\n但這種行進間的畫面就能無腦讓相機來錄\n\n如果大家對這種 Vlog 怎麼做有興趣\n和 GO Ultra 搭配哪些配件 (還有慘痛教訓 = =)\n還有怎麼讓 AI 精準知道影片中的地點等等\n歡迎留言發問，會陸陸續續整理資訊出來～","timestamp":"2026-10-18T14:10:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":118,"replies":13,"reposts":2,"shares":58},"score":150,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Del2TrKH1FN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Del2TrKH1FN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"文章連結：\nshort.darrelltw.com/zeabu…","timestamp":"2026-10-17T10:02:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DelvAONEWY_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DelvAONEWY_","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"想不到 zeabur 這次宣布要停止服務了\n那我們到底能搬移到哪？\n\n我自己是混用：VPS + Cloudflare \n靠 Claude Code 幫忙轉移大部分的服務\n\n昨天不少人推薦 Cloudflare \n我自己也有不少服務部署在 Cloudflare 也確實好用\n但目前方案還是無法滿足部分需求需要一台主機的場景\n\n這邊也介紹不同類型的專案\n其實有不同適合的方式\n\nZeabur 本質就是在 VPS 的伺服器上\n多了一層方便管理的介面\n以前有這介面會很方便\n但現在有了 AI \n就能靠 AI 來幫你做掉這些複雜的部署等等\n\n最後如果你本來的專案是商用，或是給公司內外部使用\n建議直接轉向 AWS, GCP, Azure 等環境\n因為你終究可能都要去的，不如趁現在就去\n這些費用理論上是公司付才對\n三大雲雖然比較貴，但能提供的功能和安全還是比較完整\n\n更棒的是三大雲幾乎都能讓 AI 透過終端機的方式幫忙操作部署\n之前來上課 n8n 的學生也靠自己獨立用 Claude Code 搬移到 GCP 上\n\n完整文章連結稍晚補上 📝","timestamp":"2026-10-17T08:59:08.000Z","stats":{"likes":57,"replies":7,"reposts":4,"shares":21},"score":83,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[{"id":"Deq8brJmrzw","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ironv.careerlife/post/Deq8brJmrzw","username":"ironv.careerlife","displayName":"ironv.careerlife","content":"最近遇上 zeabur 準備關閉服務，想了解如何轉移的朋友，可以參考一下 Darrell 最新文章！  Translate\n\nReplying to @darrell_tw_","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:32:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deq7p7qGihT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ironv.careerlife/post/Deq7p7qGihT","username":"ironv.careerlife","displayName":"ironv.careerlife","content":"剛剛看到 Vincent 新課程6000，創始會員直接賺爛，11/05 課程就火速上架，\n\n其實不用額外贈送，當初也準備刷，沒想到加入會員來能獲得這樣回饋，根本佛心企業。不知道另外3堂直播實戰是可以觀看還是加價購🤔\n\n之前訂閱曼報 pro ，有了孩子之後很難空出時間閱讀，推出 podcast 之後，洗小孩餵奶無痛學習，讓小孩可以提早接觸財金知識😆\n\n不知道以後會不會開發出幼兒財經，成為國民必備育兒教材","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:25:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":224,"replies":7,"reposts":1,"shares":20},"score":241,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Del2TrKH1FN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Del2TrKH1FN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Replying to @darrell_tw_","timestamp":"2026-10-17T10:02:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-10-20T16:24:43+08:00","latest":false}]}]}